OL,3,GNEWSAEating disorder 'stole my spark
OL,4,Aand personality'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHattie Whitman hit rock bottom when her
OL,7,Feating disorder began ruining her daily
OL,8,Flife and she realised she needed help.
OL,10,F"Anorexia is such a misunderstood
OL,11,Fmental illness. I had no idea when I
OL,12,Fwas struggling that I was struggling,"
OL,13,Fshe said.
OL,15,FThe 22-year-old from Guernsey began
OL,16,Fdocumenting her recovery from anorexia
OL,17,Fon social media in 2024 to "hold myself
OL,18,Faccountable" and now has more than 70k
OL,19,Ffollowers on Instagram and 145k on
OL,20,FTikTok.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
