OL,3,GNEWSAEating disorder 'stole my spark
OL,4,Aand personality'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe described sharing her journey as a
OL,7,F"privilege" and said she hoped to
OL,8,Fencourage more awareness of eating
OL,9,Fdisorders.
